  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5056,
      "text": "that this is indeed a noble Qur’an,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5057,
      "text": "in a well-preserved Record[11],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5058,
      "text": "that none can touch except the purified ones[12] –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5059,
      "text": "a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5060,
      "text": "Do you take this discourse lightly,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5061,
      "text": "and instead [of thanking Allah] for the provision you are given, you show ingratitude?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5062,
      "text": "Then why [are you helpless] when the soul reaches the throat,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5063,
      "text": "while you are looking on,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5064,
      "text": "when We are closer[13] to him than you, but you do not see?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5065,
      "text": "If you are not subject to retribution, then why do you not",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5066,
      "text": "bring that [soul] back, if you are truthful?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5067,
      "text": "If that dying person is one of those who will be brought near to Allah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5068,
      "text": "then [he will have] comfort, fragrance[14], and a Garden of Bliss.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5069,
      "text": "If he is one of the people of the right,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5070,
      "text": "[He will be told], “Peace be to you, for being one of the people of the right.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5071,
      "text": "But if he is one of the misguided deniers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5072,
      "text": "then he will be welcomed with scalding water,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5073,
      "text": "and he will burn in Blazing Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5074,
      "text": "This is indeed the absolute truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 95,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5075,
      "text": "So glorify the name of your Lord, the Most Great.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 56,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الوَاقِعَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Waaqia",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Inevitable",
        "numberOfAyahs": 96,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 96,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 471,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5076,
      "text": "All that is in the heavens and earth glorifies[1] Allah, for He is the All-Mighty, the All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 57,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَدِيدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hadid",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Iron",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 472,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5077,
      "text": "To Him belongs the dominion of the heavens and earth; He gives life and causes death, and He is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 57,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَدِيدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hadid",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Iron",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 472,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5078,
      "text": "He is the First[2] and the Last[3], the Manifest[4] and the Hidden[5], and He is All-Knowing of everything.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 57,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَدِيدِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hadid",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Iron",
        "numberOfAyahs": 29,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 537,
      "ruku": 472,
      "hizbQuarter": 215,
